      "source_text": "import TGLExt.V351ModularCutBalance\n#check TGLV350.Regular.scalarTomitaResolvent_double_cut_balance\n#print axioms TGLV350.Regular.scalarTomitaResolvent_double_cut_balance\n",
      "stdout_text": "TGLV350.Regular.scalarTomitaResolvent_double_cut_balance (P : TGLExt.SiteProfile) (ε η : ℝ) (hε : 0 < ε) (hη : 0 < η) :\n  have π := TGLV350.Regular.scalarGNSRepresentation P;\n  have J := TGLV350.Regular.scalarTomitaPolarFactor P;\n  have C := π ⟨TGLV350.Regular.regularInverseGeneratorCutoff P ε, ⋯⟩;\n  have D := TGLV350.Regular.antiunitaryConjugate J (π ⟨TGLV350.Regular.regularInverseGeneratorCutoff P η, ⋯⟩);\n  Commute (TGLV350.Regular.scalarTomitaResolvent P) C ∧\n    Commute (TGLV350.Regular.scalarTomitaResolvent P) D ∧\n      (1 - TGLV350.Regular.scalarTomitaResolvent P) * C *\n          TGLV350.Regular.antiunitaryConjugate J (π (TGLV350.Regular.regularDomainCut P η)) =\n        TGLV350.Regular.scalarTomitaResolvent P * π (TGLV350.Regular.regularDomainCut P ε) * D\n'TGLV350.Regular.scalarTomitaResolvent_double_cut_balance' depends on axioms: [propext, Classical.choice, Quot.sound]\n",
